# Back to the experimental glass density (2.20 g/cm3) at fixed volume.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data quenched.data
pair_style vashishta
pair_coeff * * SiO.1990.vashishta Si O
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
change_box all x scale 1.03622 y scale 1.03622 z scale 1.03622 remap
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press density pe
velocity all create 300 99173 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix anneal all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 5000
unfix anneal
minimize 1e-8 1e-10 2000 20000
write_data glass220.data
